Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:52:02 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Crowding-aware routing (sandbox feature Crowding)

Adds a crowding cost to RAPTOR rides from an external crowding index, a
crowdingReluctance plan argument and Leg.crowding in the GTFS GraphQL API.
